                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "9.5/10\n\nfantastic game! way better than i would expect for a free game. the only down sides are inability to reduce volumes in game (can mute, otherwise had to use volume mixer). and 2nd down side is text goes by quite quickly, would be nice to have a bit more control over that.\n\nnice challenge. completed it within a couple hours. good balance of puzzle and platformer challenges. personally i am not great at platformers, so was just the right amount of challenge that i was able to complete.\n\nedit: some issue with taking screenshots. i saw that there was only one in community page and not a very good one. thought i would fix that, but steam overlay doesnt seem to work with the game",
